    "backstory": "Born amidst the radioactive rubble of Old Subchain, Zephyr's early life was spent scavenging for scraps and dodging feral bot-dogs. The Hatchling Plague that marked his body may have weakened others, but it only hardened him, making him immune to most toxins and a surprisingly agile survivor.",
